{"summary":"Attract customers, train stars, and win the Grand Slam in this tennis club sim!","description":"Aim for the ace position of tennis club prestige in this simulation! Your leadership decides if players make it to the big time or bust! Customize your training menu to focus on power or technique, molding players as you please for competitions, fame, and snazzy sponsors!\n\nSponsors will fund hard-working athletes with big bucks, in addition to providing top-notch gear, items, and more. Some corporations might even build you a hot springs spa or restaurant! Sign with a variety of sponsors and live the good life!\n\nOh--and don't forget to beef up service for patrons of your tennis school! Hosting barbecues, training camps, and other fun events will stoke motivation. Make your tennis club a fun one to bring customers clambering!\n\nSo who will it be that commands the court? From singles and doubles to team competitions, serve up your rivals to win the Grand Slam and stock that trophy shelf!\n\n--\n* All game progress is stored on your device. Save data cannot be transferred between devices, nor can it be restored after deleting or reinstalling the app.\n* Should the screen go dark and freeze, try to power your device down and relaunch the game.\n\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp. Be sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/13v6srIsq2U?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KI7WSdWar4FNFRXOQ68IbjKkAqMZ4ZsgaXJOS0bzkhMJVmLYgF0wdzNz631NUf6G7f_QTvBuifbs4_IRO_dO","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5sWPLti-K1BKIfWTBhVJixRszP7LlUzJbkSDfWlqI4lWmm_LOvdblM23vTu7IA-K15DXd7n-OZRPKPxuCGA5","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lJkFicT3qvX827tKjDPdoyylnku1s6BTtNqV-24TVxvyCE2w5Zdv8Ei9onZ5-8uRhl-O0KyZ4-_P9b_HitsSAQ","https://play-lh.googleuser